  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Its appearance is very simple: a floating bubble with an ordinary look.",
        "chapters": [
          995
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance-and-creation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bo Qing had suffered at the hands of wisdom path Gu Immortals and wanted a method aimed at that path.",
        "chapters": [
          995
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance-and-creation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "path_wisdom",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Among Fang Yuan’s rank eight Immortal Gu it is the ordinary case: Attitude Gu has a very low requirement to use, while wisdom sword Immortal Gu needs rank eight immortal essence even when he already owns it. He still cannot activate it.",
        "chapters": [
          1468
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "activation-requirement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Purple Mountain True Monarch designed that rank eight immortal essence demand for Bo Qing. Fang Yuan still only has rank seven red date immortal essence and cannot activate it.",
        "chapters": [
          1572
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "activation-requirement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Once he has rank eight cultivation and white litchi immortal essence, wisdom sword Immortal Gu is one of the cores of Five Finger Fist Heart Sword and lets him reach its fourth sword.",
        "chapters": [
          1633
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "killer-move-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "move_five_finger_fist_heart_sword"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later modifies a killer move that uses wisdom sword Immortal Gu as the core and makes that move his main method for clearing wills while refining heaven form. Using the Gu alone in a previous life had only ordinary effect.",
        "chapters": [
          1815
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "killer-move-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_killer_moves"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Myriad Thought Sword Waterfall uses it as the core and is more effective on wills than using the Gu alone.",
        "chapters": [
          1821
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "killer-move-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "move_myriad_thought_sword_waterfall"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Wisdom sword cuts the threads of love. Bo Qing used it to cut the wisdom path dao marks left by love Gu on his body, freeing himself from those restrictions, and he used that turn of events to pull Mo Yao of Spirit Affinity House to his side.",
        "chapters": [
          1083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It is a genuine rank eight Immortal Gu and needs rank eight immortal essence to activate. Green grape immortal essence is not enough for that demand, and lower rank immortal essence is not enough for ordinary use of this Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Attitude Gu can run on mental energy and be used even by rank six Gu Immortals, while wisdom sword Immortal Gu needs rank eight immortal essence.",
        "chapters": [
          1083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_attitude_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It feeds on multicolored overlord flowers. Those flowers need large illumination, intense sweet scents, and pearl soil to mature.",
        "chapters": [
          1083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan refines rank eight Wisdom Sword with the wisdom refinement formation, together with Change Soul, Sword Eyebrows, Flying Sword, Sword Escape, and Wave Sword taken from immortal zombie Bo Qing. It is already very hard for him to use with only green grape immortal essence on hand, well short of the rank eight immortal essence it calls for. In the same stretch, he arranges feeding plans for Attitude Gu beside wisdom sword Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_change_soul_immortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
